# Stackra file contract:
# Purpose: where npm and npx read Figentra's open scopes: Flow (@figentra-oss) and the framework it builds on
#          (@stackra), both from the Stackra registry, which serves them without a token. Everything else
#          comes from npmjs.
# Boundary: registry mapping only; never a token (a job that needs one writes it to ~/.npmrc).
# Runtime: node
# Governing contract: Stackra ADR 0453 (the registry, decision 10: open scopes)
@figentra-oss:registry=https://npm.stackra.figentra.com/
@stackra:registry=https://npm.stackra.figentra.com/
